{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>李佳芯與林愷鈴今日聯同呂爵安現身汽車品牌活動，為即將播出港版《悠長假期》造勢宣傳。席間眾人除分享拍攝點滴與聖誕 …</p><p></p>\n<p>李佳芯與林愷鈴今日聯同呂爵安現身汽車品牌活動，為即將播出港版《悠長假期》造勢宣傳。席間眾人除分享拍攝點滴與聖誕動向，更罕有回應近日城中熱話。面對昔日緋聞對象破產及走數傳聞，壽星女李佳芯親自揭開二人金錢轇轕真實內幕。</p>\n<h2>港版《悠長假期》宣傳活動大爆拍攝秘辛</h2>\n<p>港版《悠長假期》落實於聖誕及跨年檔期播出，李佳芯與林愷鈴及呂爵安今日齊齊出席汽車品牌宣傳活動。李佳芯坦言看過劇集製作特輯後才驚覺自己擁有偶像包袱，回想當時日夜顛倒拍攝至天昏地暗，更對著鏡頭講出大量廢話並留下不少黑圖，對最終剪輯效果感到十分好奇。明日迎來生日兼聖誕佳節將至，李佳芯透露節日期間仍需繼續開工拍劇，而同場拍檔亦有即場向壽星女送上祝福。</p>\n<h2>李佳芯親自澄清陳恩德走數傳聞真相</h2>\n<p>針對昔日緋聞對象蟲草大王陳恩德近日遭入稟申請破產一事，坊間更有傳聞指男方昔日食飯走數，李佳芯受訪時大方作出回應。她明確澄清自己並無遭遇走數情況，更笑言：「我有請佢飲嘢。」以幽默方式化解外界對二人金錢糾紛疑慮。另一方面，林愷鈴成為駕車話題焦點，尚未考獲車牌卻下定決心考牌，全因拍戲經常需要駕駛戲份，她直言：「唔想一生人靠綠幕生存。」</p>\n<h2>林愷鈴力撐《金童》拍檔張繼聰進步神速</h2>\n<p>談及過往合作經歷與背景，林愷鈴曾於電影《金童》中首度擔正女主角，她對昔日拍檔張繼聰角逐金馬獎感觸良多，大讚對方非常努力且進步神速，看到拍檔在電影大舞台上發光感到由衷感動。至於考車牌背後另一動機，林愷鈴透露若成功考牌並買入寵物友善座駕，最希望載母親龔慈恩愛犬出遊，以分擔母親近期忙於準備人生首個舞台劇演出壓力。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議呂爵安《悠長假期》預告片造型</h2>\n<p>隨著港版《悠長假期》預告片曝光，網上隨即掀起熱烈討論，不少網民對這個新鮮組合表示期待。針對呂爵安擔心自己在預告片中造型狼狽會顯得太過殘樣，網民紛紛留言表示：「預告入面其實好靚仔！」李佳芯與林愷鈴亦一致力撐拍檔造型具備吸引力。同時有網民對林愷鈴拒絕依賴綠幕大表讚賞，留言稱：「為咗拍戲去考車牌真係好敬業！」認為其專業態度值得肯定。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568560695776023_10283107336b07fce8115f0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262364.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568560695776023_10283107336b07fce8115f0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568561044631751_16131361536b07fceadb98c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262371.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568561044631751_16131361536b07fceadb98c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568561273951180_12766628136b07fced3ee30.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262363.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568561273951180_12766628136b07fced3ee30.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568561490646661_1966547226b07fcef7a4cd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262370.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568561490646661_1966547226b07fcef7a4cd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956856172834650_10890837986b07fcf1e2505.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262368.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956856172834650_10890837986b07fcf1e2505.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568562083426198_564435716b07fcf5bbd73.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262367.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568562083426198_564435716b07fcf5bbd73.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568562400290516_19116388326b07fcf85c756.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262361.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568562400290516_19116388326b07fcf85c756.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%82%a0%e9%95%b7%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">悠長假期</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%8e%e4%bd%b3%e8%8a%af/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">李佳芯</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9e%97%e6%84%b7%e9%88%b4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">林愷鈴</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3550593\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 26 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:23:55.217251+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1294,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T12:33:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T23:17:51.875023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:17:27.541162+00:00","content_hash":"05fbc6f4ee7c5afcaa6a95686532ccc525ed19278ff76317f402d897c89501cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}